# Memory Protocol

Canonical project memory lives in `docs/ai-context/`.

Do not save assumptions as facts. Mark unresolved items in `OPEN_THREADS.md`.

Keep `CURRENT_STATE.md` concise and present-tense. Keep `HANDOFF.md` optimized for the next agent chat.

Do not duplicate the same context across every memory file. Thinktank is advisory only and must not override this repo.
